{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/0ccf81ba4b1e380cae9d39b89b7adf62.avif?t=1769379303\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granny has disappeared and there are cats causing mayhem all over the world! Use your gadgets and abilities to put a stop to the kitty-chaos, and figure out what happened to Granny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1769379303\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Use your gadgets and abilities to capture the cats that are scattered about the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1769379303\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Each cat has unique stats and abilities, learn what tools and requirements each cat needs to be captured. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1769379303\" width=32 height=32 /></span>After capturing a cat, they will get added to the cat caf\u00e9 where they can be safely looked after until Granny is found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1769379303\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Collect coins and unlock cosmetics for the cat caf\u00e9, watch it develop from an empty building to a bustling cat paradise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/941a0474d38229744d84914dfb0a0355.avif?t=1769379303\" width=600 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with quirky allies and explore the world of Snyatcher to unravel the mystery of Granny's disappearance!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2699530?t=1769379303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769379303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769379303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769379303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/0ccf81ba4b1e380cae9d39b89b7adf62.avif?t=1769379303\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granny has disappeared and there are cats causing mayhem all over the world! Use your gadgets and abilities to put a stop to the kitty-chaos, and figure out what happened to Granny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1769379303\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Use your gadgets and abilities to capture the cats that are scattered about the game's levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.aka